  "description": "Streaming abuse / heavy-hitter detection in fixed memory: a single Observe(key) fans a request key into a Count-Min rate sketch, a Space-Saving top-offenders sketch, a HyperLogLog distinct-volume estimator, and a Bloom first-seen filter — all bounded so an attacker rotating keys cannot grow it unbounded. Generic over the caller's key type and a zero-cost inlined Celerity hasher, mergeable for per-core striping and fleet rollup. Built on Celerity.Collections.",
